          "type": "user",
          "text": "# AI SDK 4.0 to 5.0 Breaking Changes Summary\n\n## Package Updates\n- `ai`: 5.0.0\n- `@ai-sdk/provider`: 2.0.0\n- `@ai-sdk/provider-utils`: 3.0.0\n- `@ai-sdk/*` packages: 2.0.0\n- `zod`: 4.1.8+ (required for TypeScript performance)\n\n## Core API Changes\n\n### Function Parameter Renames\n- `maxTokens` → `maxOutputTokens`\n- `providerMetadata` → `providerOptions` (input only; output still uses `providerMetadata`)\n- `parameters` → `inputSchema` in tool definitions\n- `experimental_toToolResultContent` → `toModelOutput`\n\n### Message Type Renames\n- `CoreMessage` → `ModelMessage`\n- `Message` → `UIMessage`\n- `CreateMessage` → `CreateUIMessage`\n- `convertToCoreMessages()` → `convertToModelMessages()`\n\n### UIMessage Structure Changes\n- `.content` property → `.parts` array structure\n- Tool parts: `toolInvocation.args/result` → specific tool type names (e.g., `tool-getWeather`)\n- `reasoning` property → `parts` array with reasoning type\n- File parts: `.mimeType` → `.mediaType`; `.data` → `.url`\n- Removed `data` role entirely\n\n### Tool-Related Changes\n- Tool call/result properties: \"args\"/\"result\" → \"input\"/\"output\"\n- Removed `ToolExecutionError` class\n- `toolCallStreaming` removed (now always enabled)\n- Tool states: \"partial-call\"/\"call\"/\"result\" → \"input-streaming\"/\"input-available\"/\"output-available\"/\"output-error\"\n\n## UI Framework Changes\n\n### Package Restructuring\n- `ai/rsc` → `@ai-sdk/rsc` package\n- `ai/react` deprecated → use `@ai-sdk/react`\n- `@ai-sdk/ui-utils` removed; exports moved to `ai`\n\n### useChat Hook Redesign\n- Removed `initialMessages`; renamed to `messages`\n- `input/handleInputChange/handleSubmit` removed (manage manually)\n- `append()` → `sendMessage()`\n- `reload()` → `regenerate()`\n- `addToolResult()` → `addToolOutput()`\n- `maxSteps` removed; use server-side `stopWhen` instead\n- `onResponse` callback removed\n- `sendExtraMessageFields` removed (now default)\n- Chat transport configuration required via `DefaultChatTransport`\n\n### Vue Integration (@ai-sdk/vue)\n- `useChat` composable → `Chat` class constructor\n- Properties now read-only; use setter methods\n- Message structure changed from `.content` to `.parts`\n\n## Streaming Architecture\n\n### Stream Protocol Changes\n- Single chunks → start/delta/end pattern with unique IDs\n- `textDelta` → `delta` property\n- Tool input now streams: \"tool-input-start\"/\"tool-input-delta\"/\"tool-input-end\"\n- Proprietary protocol → Server-Sent Events\n\n### Response Functions\n- `toDataStreamResponse()` → `toUIMessageStreamResponse()`\n- `pipeDataStreamToResponse()` → `pipeUIMessageStreamToResponse()`\n- \"step-finish\" event → \"finish-step\"\n- `usage` → `totalUsage` in finish events\n\n## Step Control\n- `maxSteps` parameter → `stopWhen` with helpers like `stepCountIs()`, `hasToolCall()`\n- `experimental_continueSteps` removed\n- Usage properties: single-step `usage` vs. total `totalUsage`\n\n## Provider Changes\n\n### LanguageModel Interface\n- Import `LanguageModelV2` from `@ai-sdk/provider` instead of `ai`\n- Token properties: \"promptTokens\"/\"completionTokens\" → \"inputTokens\"/\"outputTokens\"/\"totalTokens\"\n- `rawResponse` → `response`\n\n### OpenAI-Specific\n- Default instance uses Responses API (use `openai.chat()` for Chat Completions)\n- `strictSchemas` → `strictJsonSchema` (defaults to `false`)\n- `structuredOutputs` moved to `providerOptions`\n- `compatibility`, `useLegacyFunctionCalls`, `simulateStreaming` removed/refactored\n\n### Removed Middleware Prefix\n- `experimental_wrapLanguageModel` → `wrapLanguageModel`\n- `experimental_activeTools` → `activeTools`\n- `experimental_prepareStep` → `prepareStep`\n\n## Data & State Management\n\n### Custom Data Streaming\n- `StreamData` class removed\n- `writeMessageAnnotation()` and `writeData()` removed\n- Use `createUIMessageStream()` with custom data parts instead\n- Message-level metadata via `messageMetadata()` callback\n\n### Message Persistence\n- Helper functions removed: `appendResponseMessages`, `appendClientMessage`\n- Use `toUIMessageStreamResponse()` with `originalMessages` and `generateMessageId` parameters\n\n## Miscellaneous\n\n### ID Generation\n- `createIdGenerator()` now requires `size` parameter at creation (not at call time)\n- `IDGenerator` → `IdGenerator` type name\n\n### Embeddings\n- Model settings → `providerOptions`\n- `rawResponse` → `response`\n- `embedMany()` supports `maxParallelCalls` option\n\n### Reasoning Support\n- `.reasoning` → `.reasoningText` for step results\n- Reasoning parts use `.text` property instead of `.reasoning`\n\n### Removed Features\n- `useAssistant` hook entirely removed\n- `experimental_attachments` → message `.parts` array with file type\n- Data role removed from messages\n- Temperature no longer defaults to 0\n\n---\n\n**Codemods Available**: Run `npx @ai-sdk/codemod upgrade` or `npx @ai-sdk/codemod v5` to automatically apply many transformations.",
